OL,3,AAlaska governor orders probe into
OL,4,ADemocratic campaign's alleged links to
OL,5,Asame-name candidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Republican governor of Alaska has
OL,8,Fordered an investigation into an
OL,9,Falleged "scheme" which led to two Dan
OL,10,FSullivans standing in the state's US
OL,11,FSenate race.
OL,13,FGovernor Mike Dunleavy said he was
OL,14,Fresponding to a New York Times (NYT)
OL,15,Fstory which said the team of Democratic
OL,16,Fcandidate Mary Peltola worked with
OL,17,Fpeople who tried to recruit spoiler
OL,18,Fcandidates in the Senate race.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
