OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAlaska governor orders probe into
OL,4,ADemocratic campaign's alleged links to
OL,5,Asame-name candidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe governor's post on X said he would
OL,8,Finvestigate "whether this scheme
OL,9,Fviolated Alaska's laws". He did not say
OL,10,Fwhich laws he had in mind.
OL,12,FDan Sullivan, the incumbent Republican
OL,13,Fsenator running for re-election, and
OL,14,Fallies have accused the Democrats of
OL,15,Ftrying to confuse voters. Peltola's
OL,16,Fteam deny any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
